# Token Usage & Pricing Analysis for PolicyWallet

**Date:** February 4, 2026  
**Status:** Analysis & Implementation Plan  
**Target Profit Margin:** 25% on AI token costs

---

## 📊 Executive Summary

This document analyzes AI token usage costs for PolicyWallet and proposes a pricing model that ensures 25% profit margin on token costs while offering on-demand token purchases for paid users.

**Key Findings:**
- Free tier: €0.42/month in AI costs → Covered by user acquisition value
- Essential tier: €1.20/month in AI costs → €2.99 pricing = 150% markup (60% profit margin)
- Professional tier: €4.80/month in AI costs → €19.99 pricing = 316% markup (76% profit margin)

**Recommendation:** Current pricing already exceeds 25% profit margin. Implement token tracking and offer on-demand purchases at €5 per 1M tokens (50% markup).

---

## 🤖 AI Model Costs (Google Gemini 2.0 Flash)

**Current Pricing (as of Feb 2026):**
- **Input tokens:** $0.075 per 1M tokens (€0.070 per 1M)
- **Output tokens:** $0.30 per 1M tokens (€0.28 per 1M)
- **Average cost:** ~€0.175 per 1M tokens (mixed input/output)

**Conversion Rate:** $1 = €0.93 (approximate)

---

## 📈 Usage Projections by Tier

### **Free Tier (3 policies max)**

**Monthly Usage Estimate:**
- **Policy uploads:** 3 policies/month
- **AI analysis per policy:** ~50K tokens (input + output)
- **Gap detection:** 3 analyses × 30K tokens = 90K tokens
- **Q&A sessions:** 0 (feature locked)
- **Total:** ~240K tokens/month

**Monthly AI Cost:**
- 240K tokens × €0.175 per 1M = **€0.042/month**

**Annual AI Cost:** €0.50/user

**Strategy:** Loss leader for user acquisition. Acceptable cost for conversion funnel.

---

### **Essential Tier (10 policies, €2.99/month)**

**Monthly Usage Estimate:**
- **Policy uploads:** 5 new policies/month (average)
- **AI analysis per policy:** ~50K tokens = 250K tokens
- **Gap detection:** 5 analyses × 30K tokens = 150K tokens
- **Q&A sessions:** 10 questions × 20K tokens = 200K tokens
- **Email notifications:** 5 notifications × 5K tokens = 25K tokens
- **Re-analysis:** 2 policies × 50K tokens = 100K tokens
- **Total:** ~725K tokens/month

**Monthly AI Cost:**
- 725K tokens × €0.175 per 1M = **€0.127/month**

**Profit Analysis:**
- Revenue: €2.99/month
- AI cost: €0.127/month
- Stripe fees (2.9% + €0.25): €0.34/month
- **Net profit:** €2.52/month
- **Profit margin on AI costs:** 2,254% ✅
- **Overall profit margin:** 84%

---

### **Professional Tier (Unlimited policies, €19.99/month)**

**Monthly Usage Estimate (Agent with 20 clients):**
- **Policy uploads:** 20 new policies/month
- **AI analysis per policy:** ~50K tokens = 1M tokens
- **Gap detection:** 20 analyses × 30K tokens = 600K tokens
- **Q&A sessions:** 50 questions × 20K tokens = 1M tokens
- **Client reports:** 20 reports × 40K tokens = 800K tokens
- **Opportunity analysis:** 10 analyses × 50K tokens = 500K tokens
- **Re-analysis:** 10 policies × 50K tokens = 500K tokens
- **Total:** ~4.4M tokens/month

**Monthly AI Cost:**
- 4.4M tokens × €0.175 per 1M = **€0.77/month**

**Profit Analysis:**
- Revenue: €19.99/month
- AI cost: €0.77/month
- Stripe fees (2.9% + €0.25): €0.83/month
- **Net profit:** €18.39/month
- **Profit margin on AI costs:** 2,495% ✅
- **Overall profit margin:** 92%

