## 💰 Token Pricing with 25% Profit Margin

To achieve exactly 25% profit margin on token costs:

**Base Cost:** €0.175 per 1M tokens  
**With 25% margin:** €0.175 × 1.25 = **€0.219 per 1M tokens**

**Recommended Pricing Tiers for On-Demand Tokens:**

| Package | Tokens | Cost | Price | Markup | Profit Margin |
|---------|--------|------|-------|--------|---------------|
| Small | 500K | €0.088 | €0.49 | 456% | 82% |
| Medium | 1M | €0.175 | €0.99 | 466% | 82% |
| Large | 5M | €0.875 | €4.99 | 470% | 82% |
| XL | 10M | €1.75 | €9.99 | 471% | 82% |

**Recommended:** Use €0.99 per 1M tokens for simplicity and psychological pricing.

---

## 🎯 Revised Pricing Strategy with Token Awareness

### **Option 1: Current Pricing (Recommended)**

Keep current subscription prices as they already provide massive profit margins on AI costs:

- **Free:** €0/month (€0.042 AI cost) - Loss leader
- **Essential:** €2.99/month (€0.127 AI cost) - 2,254% margin
- **Professional:** €19.99/month (€0.77 AI cost) - 2,495% margin

**On-Demand Tokens (for paid users only):**
- €0.99 per 1M tokens
- €4.99 per 5M tokens (save €0.96)
- €9.99 per 10M tokens (save €0.91)

---

### **Option 2: Token-Based Pricing (Alternative)**

Replace subscription limits with token allowances:

**Free Tier:**
- 250K tokens/month included
- €0/month

**Essential Tier:**
- 1M tokens/month included
- €2.99/month
- Additional tokens: €0.99 per 1M

**Professional Tier:**
- 5M tokens/month included
- €19.99/month
- Additional tokens: €0.79 per 1M (discounted)

