## 📊 Expected Results & ROI Analysis

### **Scenario 1: Current Pricing (Recommended)**

**Assumptions:**
- 1,000 users after 6 months
- 70% Free, 25% Essential, 5% Professional

**Monthly Costs:**
- Free users (700): 700 × €0.042 = €29.40
- Essential users (250): 250 × €0.127 = €31.75
- Professional users (50): 50 × €0.77 = €38.50
- **Total AI costs:** €99.65/month

**Monthly Revenue:**
- Essential: 250 × €2.99 = €747.50
- Professional: 50 × €19.99 = €999.50
- Token purchases (estimated): €150/month
- **Total revenue:** €1,897/month

**Monthly Profit:**
- Revenue: €1,897
- AI costs: €99.65
- Stripe fees: €170
- **Net profit:** €1,627/month (86% margin)

**Annual Projection:**
- Revenue: €22,764
- AI costs: €1,196
- **Net profit:** €19,524

---

### **Scenario 2: With Heavy Token Purchases**

**Assumptions:**
- 20% of paid users buy tokens monthly
- Average purchase: €4.99 (5M tokens)

**Additional Monthly Revenue:**
- (250 + 50) × 20% × €4.99 = €299.40

**Additional Monthly Costs:**
- 60 users × 5M tokens × €0.175 per 1M = €52.50

**Additional Monthly Profit:**
- €299.40 - €52.50 = €246.90 (83% margin)

